-- The six amounts of subsection 8(2), one rule each. They take the prorated portions as plain figures
-- (subsections (4) to (11) above work them out).

-- src:187 | Excess amount
-- src:188 | (2) An excess amount has been paid if the aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of an employee for a year, whether by one or more employers, on account of the employee’s contributions for the year under this Act or under a provincial pension plan exceeds the sum obtained by adding the following amounts:
-- src:189 | (a) the product obtained when the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act is multiplied by the lesser of
-- src:190 | (i) the employee’s contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply, plus the employee’s contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply, minus the prorated portion of the employee’s basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4), and
-- src:191 | (ii) the prorated portion of the employee’s maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5);
@ref Act s 8(2)(a) (src:189-191)
GIVEN `the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)` IS A NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 8(2)(a) — the product of the contribution rate for employees under this Act and the lesser of the two amounts`
        `the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
        `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)`
    MEANS
        `the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
        TIMES (min `subparagraph (i)` `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)`)
    WHERE
        -- (i) wages, plus the self-employed earnings, minus the prorated basic exemption
        `subparagraph (i)` MEANS
            (`the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
             PLUS (fromMaybe 0 `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`))
            MINUS `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)`

-- src:192 | (a.1) for 2019 and each subsequent year, the product obtained when the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act is multiplied by the lesser of
-- src:193 | (i) the employee’s contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply, plus the employee’s contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply, minus the prorated portion of the employee’s basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4), and
-- src:194 | (ii) the prorated portion of the employee’s maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5);
@ref Act s 8(2)(a.1) (src:192-194)
GIVEN year IS A NUMBER
      `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)` IS A NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 8(2)(a.1) — the product of the first additional contribution rate for employees under this Act and the lesser of the two amounts`
        year
        `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
        `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)`
    MEANS
        -- "for 2019 and each subsequent year"
        IF year AT LEAST 2019
        THEN JUST (`the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
                   TIMES (min `subparagraph (i)` `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (5)`))
        ELSE NOTHING
    WHERE
        `subparagraph (i)` MEANS
            (`the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
             PLUS (fromMaybe 0 `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`))
            MINUS `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (4)`

-- src:195 | (a.2) for 2024 and each subsequent year, the product obtained when the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act is multiplied by the amount by which
-- src:196 | (i) the employee’s contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply, plus the employee’s contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply — not exceeding the prorated portion of the employee’s additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (8),
-- src:197 | exceeds
-- src:198 | (ii) the prorated portion of the employee’s maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (9);
@ref Act s 8(2)(a.2) (src:195-198)
GIVEN year IS A NUMBER
      `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (8)` IS A NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (9)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 8(2)(a.2) — the product of the second additional contribution rate for employees under this Act and the amount by which the earnings, not exceeding the prorated additional maximum, exceed the prorated maximum`
        year
        `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
        `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (8)`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (9)`
    MEANS
        -- "for 2024 and each subsequent year"
        IF year AT LEAST 2024
        THEN JUST (`the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act`
                   TIMES (`the amount by which one amount exceeds another`
                              (min `subparagraph (i)` `the prorated portion of the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (8)`)
                              `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year calculated under subsection (9)`))
        ELSE NOTHING
    WHERE
        -- (i) wages plus self-employed earnings -- not exceeding the prorated additional maximum -- (ii) the prorated maximum
        `subparagraph (i)` MEANS
            `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`
            PLUS (fromMaybe 0 `the employee's contributory self-employed earnings for the year in the case of an individual who is described in section 10 and to whom the provisions of this Act relating to the making of contributions apply`)

-- src:199 | (b) the product obtained when the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan is multiplied by the lesser of
-- src:200 | (i) the employee’s contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of a provincial pension plan apply, minus the prorated portion of the employee’s basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (6), and
-- src:201 | (ii) the prorated portion of the employee’s maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (7);
@ref Act s 8(2)(b) (src:199-201)
GIVEN `the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS A NUMBER
      `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of a provincial pension plan apply` IS A NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (6)` IS A NUMBER
      `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (7)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 8(2)(b) — the product of the base contribution rate for employees under a provincial pension plan and the lesser of the two amounts`
        `the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan`
        `the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of a provincial pension plan apply`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (6)`
        `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (7)`
    MEANS
        `the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan`
        TIMES (min
                   (`the employee's contributory salary and wages for the year in respect of pensionable employment to which the provisions of a provincial pension plan apply`
                    MINUS `the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for the year calculated under subsection (6)`)
                   `the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year calculated under subsection (7)`)

